files/17403601/in-place-sharded-tensor.zip) fails to do a proper in-place update.\n\nThe program is equivalent to\n```\narg0 += 1\narg1 += 1\n```\n\nWhat I observe is that the 2 tensor arguments don't change.\nIt is exported from the test `ShardedTensorTest.testInPlaceUpdate` from this [PR](https://github.com/nod-ai/SHARK-Platform/pull/290).\n\n### Steps to reproduce your issue\n\n1. Extract the archive and run `compile.sh`\n2. You can't verify the result with `iree-run-module` as it does not support validating the arguments post execution. You can use the test from the referenced PR for that.\n\n### What component(s) does this issue relate to?\n\nCompiler\n\n### Version information\n\nYou may need this [patch](https://github.com/iree-org/iree/pull/18663). I was using it when testing.\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/18802/comments","created_at":"2024-10-16T23:19:33Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/18802/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/18802","id":2593241819,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/18802/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDODGgK6M6akbrb","number":18802,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/18802/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree